# Generated native folders.
#
# `android/` is deliberately COMMITTED. It carries the bespoke Play
# upload-signing config (with its refuse-to-use-the-debug-key guard) and
# `app/debug.keystore`, which defines the signature lineage that lets
# local-test APKs update in place without wiping on-device ledger data.
# Regenerating it would destroy both. Do not run `expo prebuild --clean`
# against this project. Android build artifacts stay out of Git via
# `android/.gitignore` (build/, .gradle, local.properties, .cxx/).
/ios

